    {
      "id": "tn-mtsu-suggested",
      "source": "TN-S17",
      "quote": "The student’s diploma/ transcript must reflect a distribution of college preparatory courses, similar to the core elements of the Tennessee High School Diploma. A sample of suggested courses and units are displayed below:"
    },
